  m_text: "Your goal is to rescue the princess from her prison. However, the journey
    won\u2019t be easy. Your horse has been injured and can no longer be ridden,
    forcing you to travel on foot through the deadly forest ahead. This is a place
    filled with dangers, with traps and monsters lurking in the shadows. Be cautious
    and use all the skills you possess to overcome the challenges, for the princess's
    survival depends on you."
